WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1. Open the school’s FTE reporting screen from the dashboard reporting shortcut and confirm the school.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2. Select the intended Week start and Week end. Check the year and service period.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 3. Review enrolled children, schedule counts, FTE count and the source records used for the calculation.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:40.947
Step 4. Review the weekly billing fields, external agency amount, past-due current-family AR, licensed capacity, payroll, starts and withdrawals. Explain exceptions in Notes.

00:00:40.947 --> 00:00:49.947
Step 5. Select Submit FTE Report for a new report, or Save FTE Correction for an editable existing report.

00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:58.947
Step 6. Wait for confirmation, then reopen the school/week row and verify the saved values and status.

00:00:58.947 --> 00:01:07.947
Verify the result. The intended school/week appears once with the correct status and values.

